    {
      "source": "Configures the <a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a> with the supplied\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置 <a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a> 以使用提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/EntityResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>EntityResolver</code></a> implementation that delegates to a <a href=\"BeansDtdResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeansDtdResolver</code></a>\nand a <a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a> for DTDs and XML schemas, respectively.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/EntityResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>EntityResolver</code></a> 实现，该实现委托给 <a href=\"BeansDtdResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeansDtdResolver</code></a> 和 <a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a>，分别用于处理 DTD 和 XML 模式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new DelegatingEntityResolver that delegates to\na default <a href=\"BeansDtdResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeansDtdResolver</code></a> and a default <a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 DelegatingEntityResolver，它委托给默认的<a href=\"BeansDtdResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeansDtdResolver</code></a>和一个默认的<a href=\"PluggableSchemaResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>PluggableSchemaResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new DelegatingEntityResolver that delegates to\nthe given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/EntityResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>EntityResolvers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个委托给给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/EntityResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>EntityResolvers</code></a> 的新的 DelegatingEntityResolver。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Suffix for DTD files.",
      "translation": "DTD 文件的后缀名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Suffix for schema definition files.",
      "translation": "架构定义文件的后缀名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classLoader</code> - the ClassLoader to use for loading\n(can be <code>null</code> to use the default ClassLoader)",
